<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sales.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sales.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sale at Christchurch was 448 NZ cents per kg clean versus 441 at last week's sale, Wools of New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean), were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - 806 vs 822</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - n/a vs 524</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 399 vs 391</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - 410 vs 402</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
